                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1166000                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W11663 OCH W11679-FILERNA FÖR ATT BEVAKA      *        
*                VILKA ERSÄTTNINGSMEDDELANDEN SOM VIA VIPS SKA         *        
*                SKICKAS TILL NDC                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BODIL LINDAHL                                         *        
*                KOPIA AV W11630                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  JANUARI 1999                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11660D1                                                                   
%W11173    (W11663-)                                                            
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W11660D2                                                                   
%W11679    (W11679-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W11660D3                                                                   
%W116LAND  (IN-)                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE TEMPFIL  VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (9 0)                                           
TEMP-IDARTNR     1   5  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-OLD   6   2  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-NEW   8   2  P                                                       
*                                                                               
FILE W11660D4 FB (12 0)                                                         
%W11173    (W11663SORT-)                                                        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11660D5 FB (11 0)                                                         
%W11661    (W11661-)                                                            
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
SPAR-IDARTNR     W  5 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-OLD   W  2 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-NEW   W  2 P                                                         
*                                                                               
IX1-LAND          W  5 N VALUE  0                                               
IX1-LAND-TOT      W  5 N VALUE  0                                               
TAB-VIPS          W 80 A                                                        
TAB-VIPS-LINE     W  4 A OCCURS 20                                              
TAB-IDLANDX2-VIPS TAB-VIPS-LINE     2 A                                         
*                                                                               
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
********SORTERAR INKOMMANDE TRANSFILEN OCH BEHANDLAR EVENTUELLA                 
*******ARTIKELNUMMERDUBBLETTER                                                  
*                                                                               
SORT W11660D1 TO W11660D4 USING (W11663-IDARTNR, W11663-IDLOPNR)                
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W11660D4                                        +                     
                                         START   A-INIT   +                     
                                         FINISH  Z-FINIT                        
IF RECORD-COUNT = 1                                                             
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11663SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11663SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11663SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
IF SPAR-IDARTNR = W11663SORT-IDARTNR                                            
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11663SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
ELSE                                                                            
    TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                               
    TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                             
    TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                             
    PUT TEMPFIL                                                                 
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11663SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11663SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11663SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
A-INIT.   PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
IX1-LAND = 0                                                                    
GET W11660D3                                                                    
DO WHILE NOT EOF W11660D3                                                       
   IX1-LAND = IX1-LAND + 1                                                      
   TAB-IDLANDX2-VIPS(IX1-LAND) = IN-IDLANDX2                                    
   IX1-LAND-TOT = IX1-LAND                                                      
   GET W11660D3                                                                 
END-DO                                                                          
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
Z-FINIT.  PROC                                                                  
      TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                             
      TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                           
      TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                           
      PUT TEMPFIL                                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TEMPFIL KEY(TEMP-IDARTNR) W11660D2 KEY(W11679-IDARTNR))              
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
  W11661-IDARTNR                 =  W11679-IDARTNR                              
  W11661-IDLANDX2                =  W11679-IDLANDX2                             
  IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW              =  W11679-KDERS                                
    W11661-KDERS                 =  W11679-KDERS                                
    W11661-FLERSATT              = 'N'                                          
    IF W11679-FLERSATT           = 'J'                                          
        W11661-FLSALDOCH         = 'N'                                          
    ELSE                                                                        
        W11661-FLSALDOCH         = 'J'                                          
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    PUT W11660D5                                                                
                                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
                                                                                
    IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  20                                          
      W11661-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
      W11661-FLERSATT            = 'N'                                          
      IF W11679-FLERSATT         = 'J'                                          
          W11661-FLSALDOCH       = 'N'                                          
      ELSE                                                                      
          W11661-FLSALDOCH       = 'J'                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
      PUT W11660D5                                                              
                                                                                
    ELSE                                                                        
                                                                                
      IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  0        +                                
      AND TEMP-KDERS-NEW           <  20                                        
        W11661-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                            
        W11661-FLERSATT            = 'N'                                        
        W11661-FLSALDOCH           = 'J'                                        
        PUT W11660D5                                                            
                                                                                
      ELSE                                                                      
                                                                                
       IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW          =  0                                          
          W11661-KDERS           =  0                                           
          W11661-FLERSATT        =  W11679-FLERSATT                             
          W11661-FLSALDOCH       = 'N'                                          
          PUT W11660D5                                                          
       END-IF                                                                   
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
ELSE                                                                            
                                                                                
  IF TEMPFIL                                                                    
    IX1-LAND = 1                                                                
    DO WHILE IX1-LAND < (IX1-LAND-TOT + 1)                                      
       W11661-IDARTNR                =  TEMP-IDARTNR                            
       W11661-IDLANDX2               =  TAB-IDLANDX2-VIPS(IX1-LAND)             
       IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW  > 0              +                                    
       AND TEMP-KDERS-NEW < 20                                                  
          W11661-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                          
          W11661-FLERSATT            = 'N'                                      
          W11661-FLSALDOCH           = 'J'                                      
          PUT W11660D5                                                          
       ELSE                                                                     
          IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW          >  20                                      
            W11661-KDERS             =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                          
            W11661-FLERSATT          = 'N'                                      
            W11661-FLSALDOCH         = 'J'                                      
            PUT W11660D5                                                        
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
       IX1-LAND = IX1-LAND + 1                                                  
    END-DO                                                                      
                                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
                                                                                
    IF W11660D2                                                                 
      W11661-IDARTNR             =  W11679-IDARTNR                              
      W11661-IDLANDX2            =  W11679-IDLANDX2                             
      W11661-KDERS               =  W11679-KDERS                                
      W11661-FLERSATT            =  W11679-FLERSATT                             
      W11661-FLSALDOCH           = 'J'                                          
      IF W11679-KDERS > 0                                                       
         IF W11679-KDERS < 20                                                   
            W11661-FLSALDOCH           = 'N'                                    
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
      PUT W11660D5                                                              
    END-IF                                                                      
   END-IF                                                                       
 END-IF                                                                         
*                                                                               
